## 3. Upstream Attribution & Upstream CAD Notice

The 3D watch body geometry in this repository is derived from the official 3D CAD drawings released by **Pebble Technology Corporation** in the official `pebble/pebble-3d` repository:

* **Upstream Repository:** [https://github.com/pebble/pebble-3d](https://github.com/pebble/pebble-3d)
* **Original Model:** `PebbleSolid-20130102.STL` / `PebbleSolid-20130102.STEP`
* **Original Copyright:** © 2013, 2014, 2015, 2016 Pebble Technology Corporation. All Rights Reserved.
* **Pebble CAD Statement:**
  > *"Here's the moment you've all been waiting for: the release of Pebble's 3D drawings. We're looking forward to seeing some awesome designs on thingiverse! Where possible, PDF, STL, and STP files are included. FILES ARE FOR REFERENCE ONLY. SUBJECT TO CHANGE WITHOUT NOTICE. All Rights Reserved. 2013, 2014, 2015, 2016 Pebble Technology Corporation."*

The modifications in this project (scaling by $4.314\times$, cutting the through-hole screen aperture, carving the rear drop-in pocket and bezel retaining lip for the Barnes & Noble Nook Simple Touch, bottom micro-USB cable routing, and wall-mounting keyholes) are released to the community in the spirit of Pebble's original invitation to share awesome designs on Thingiverse and MakerWorld.

